;timestamp=1605812674" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="open-menu"> <p><a href="#side-bar">≡</a></p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4255421&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605812674" alt="Jochoi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4255421)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" >Jochoi</a></span></p> 
