架</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%E3%81%8B%E3%81%9F%E3%82%8A%E3%81%B9.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%E3%81%8B%E3%81%9F%E3%82%8A%E3%81%B9.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>知识的火花</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在被放逐者之图书馆里面有五篇及以上文章</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%9F%AD%E7%B7%A8%E9%9B%86.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%9F%AD%E7%B7%A8%E9%9B%86.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>守藏史</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在被放逐者之图书馆里面有个人书架</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%82%93%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A7%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%82%93%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A7%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>读书人的事，能叫抄么</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在一篇文章里大量引用或改造其他地方的句子、段落、故事情节</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>画蛇添足足足足足足足</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在一篇文章里面有超过100个的脚注</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E8%AD%9A.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E8%AD%9A.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>弑神者</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在文章中，人类尝试消灭一个至高神性</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E7%94%B7.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%8A%E7%A5%AD%E3%82%8A%E7%94%B7.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>神灵秘辛</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在另一篇文章里，以一神性实体为主角</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%80%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A4%E3%82%B6%E3%83%AF.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%80%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A4%E3%82%B6%E3%83%AF.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>狭路相逢勇者胜</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>去作死，结果被删文档而其他人用类似的手法存活</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%90%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%90%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>率性翻译</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>对读者说看不懂的可以去看原文</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%95%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AB%E3%83%A1%E3%83%A9%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%83%95%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AB%E3%83%A1%E3%83%A9%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>采风者</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>成为基金会分部里面创作和翻译诗歌的数量最多的人</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>版式先生</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>大量搬运主站的版式，并从中创作原创版式</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_SCP%E3%81%AF%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%90.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_SCP%E3%81%AF%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%90.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>世界的齿轮</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在一篇文章里有超过30个的外部链接，链接其他文档将其作为世界观的一部分</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>思维灰烬</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>总是没办法将点子变现成文章而变成鸽子先生</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E3%81%98%E3%82%83%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E3%81%98%E3%82%83%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>诗含神雾</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在基金会里面写丹方/谶歌</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://zok6hoi2.wdfiles.com/local--files/home%3Ahome/SCP_Jochoi_600px.png" width="50" alt="SCP_Jochoi_600px.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#ad9140"><strong>凿凿的奇妙冒险</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>将凿海写成殴打鲨鱼中心音击术先祖并演绎成凿海家族</strong></span></p> </div> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>正常的</strong></span></p> <hr /> <p>不必要</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-7" style="display:none"> <p><br /></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><strong>笺注</strong></span></p> <hr /> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 即自身休谟水平随周围环境变化而随之改变与其持平</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 有人称这其实是小型现实稳定锚，用来稳定其自身形态</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. 不计合著、短篇与支援文章的数目。且此后的筛选都是按更新时间做排序的</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. 目前不计搬运的主题和组件的数目。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. RPC管理局的翻译，去我RPC的工作台看看就好了</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. .<br /> <strong>原作</strong>：<em>The Court of the Crimson King</em><br /> <strong>译者</strong>：赵暗花</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. 事实证明草稿放在自己网站比较安全。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-556890-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. 为了避免使用 Include 预设的书籍时，css 被重复引用，而单独分开。</div> </div> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;什么也不是</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/etinjat/html/7c19884bdab4241a78bfb6d2aa8ce8c2ce1bcb99-4386467372098925666" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p style="text-align: center;">&#171; <a href="http://etinjat.wikidot.com/">私人维度</a> | 基金会时空：中文分部-<a href="http://scp-zh-tr.wikidot.com/etinjat">繁中分部</a> | <a href="http://rpc-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/etinjat-s-personnel-file">管理局位面</a> &#187;</p> <p><a name="bottom"></a> [ <a href="#top">△ 回到顶部</a> ]</p> </div> <div class="pseudo-tags"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E7%90%85%E5%AC%9B%E7%A6%8F%E5%9C%B0%E8%97%8F%E4%B9%A6%E9%98%81#pages">琅嬛阁主</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E6%96%87%E8%A8%80%E6%96%87#pages">异学祭酒</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E8%AF%97%E6%AD%8C#pages">远游骚客</a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;">阴阳之道</a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;">乌有之兽</a></li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="javascript:;">鸽子</a></span></li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="javascript:;">武陵人</a></span></li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605812677" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></p> 
